commit 87ef95d21c1b0dc80fca50d61eed218089b23150
Author: Matthijs van Henten <[REDACTED-EMAIL]>
Date:   Mon Sep 28 05:50:11 2026 +0000

    feat: colour picker with rgb on every object

    Every object and live ink frame carries rgb (0..0xFFFFFF) next to colour,
    which now holds the nearest palette index. Objects written before rgb lack
    it; readers derive it from the palette, and the codec always writes it.
    The palette gets a colour picker, hex entry and the last 8 colours used on
    the device. stroke-legacy.cbor.hex pins a pre-rgb stroke for both sides.

    Closes #21

